Servex hasn't been restarted yet: the voice-directives change was still only a written brief, so restarting now would have put nothing new live. A Sonnet worker is building that change now, with orders to force the Servex restart as soon as it merges. That restart will drop any open voice call.

**Past-work:** `node Server/PastWork.mjs <topic>` is a plain keyword search, with no agent behind it. It searches four places and prints the top 12 matches on one screen:
- every task log (title, request, outcome, group and landed date);
- the owner's asks list (`asks.jsonl`);
- the readmes and doc fil
